# --- git-lfs: rentearth textures ----------------------------------------
# Binary art, kept out of git history. Below the `* text=auto` rule and
# carrying -text, because a later rule wins per attribute and eol translation
# would corrupt them.
#
# Not under a private/ path on purpose: git allows one filter per file, so LFS
# and git-crypt are mutually exclusive. These are MIT-licensed textures anyone
# can fetch from upstream, so there is nothing to encrypt -- the reason to move
# them was history weight, not secrecy.
apps/arcade/rentearth-bevy/assets/**/*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
